step.instructions:
Runs ${instance-JAVA_HOME}/bin/java -version and extracts the major version number.
PASS : Java major version >= 17 FAIL : Java not found at JAVA_HOME, or major version is less than 17
Zowe V3 requirement: Java 17 minimum. Current JAVA_HOME: ${instance-JAVA_HOME}

Runs ${instance-NODE_HOME}/bin/node --version and extracts the major version number.
PASS : Node.js major version >= 18 FAIL : Node.js not found at NODE_HOME, or major version less than 18
Zowe V3 requirement: Node.js 18 minimum. Current NODE_HOME: ${instance-NODE_HOME}

Constructs the readiness summary string from captured values:
  z/OSMF version : ${instance-ZOSMF_VERSION}
  z/OS system    : ${instance-ZOSMF_SYSTEM}

All check steps have completed. Review each step's job output
on the JES spool for detailed PASS/WARN/FAIL results before
proceeding to the approval gate.

Writes the complete readiness report to ${instance-REPORT_USS_PATH} and prints it to STDOUT on the JES spool.
The report captures all input variables and the readiness summary in a single timestamped document suitable for attaching to a change record or upgrade ticket.
Retrieve after the workflow with: zowe zos-files view uss-file ${instance-REPORT_USS_PATH}

template.inlineTemplate:
#!/bin/sh REPORT="${instance-REPORT_USS_PATH}" TS=$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') APPROVER=$(id 2>/dev/null | cut -d'(' -f2 | cut -d')' -f1)
echo "============================================================" > "$REPORT" echo " Zowe V3 Upgrade Readiness Report" >> "$REPORT" echo " Generated : $TS" >> "$REPORT" echo " System : ${instance-ZOSMF_SYSTEM}" >> "$REPORT" echo " z/OSMF : ${instance-ZOSMF_VERSION}" >> "$REPORT" echo "============================================================" >> "$REPORT" echo "" >> "$REPORT" echo "CONFIGURATION REVIEWED" >> "$REPORT" echo " Zowe zFS mount : ${instance-ZOWE_ZFS_MOUNT}" >> "$REPORT" echo " Zowe yaml : ${instance-ZOWE_YAML_PATH}" >> "$REPORT" echo " Zowe PROCLIB : ${instance-ZOWE_PROCLIB}" >> "$REPORT" echo " Keyring owner : ${instance-KEYRING_OWNER}" >> "$REPORT" echo " Keyring name : ${instance-KEYRING_NAME}" >> "$REPORT" echo " Cert warn days : ${instance-CERT_WARN_DAYS}" >> "$REPORT" echo " Java home : ${instance-JAVA_HOME}" >> "$REPORT" echo " Node home : ${instance-NODE_HOME}" >> "$REPORT" echo "" >> "$REPORT" echo "ZOWE V3 REQUIREMENTS" >> "$REPORT" echo " Java : 17 minimum - see checkJava step output" >> "$REPORT" echo " Node.js : 18 minimum - see checkNode step output" >> "$REPORT" echo " zFS space : 2 GB minimum - see checkZfsSpace output" >> "$REPORT" echo " Certificates : No expired - see checkCertExpiry output" >> "$REPORT" echo " PROCLIB : ZWESISTC, ZWESLSTC - see checkZoweProc" >> "$REPORT" echo " RACF groups : ZWESIGRP, ZWEADMIN - see checkRacfGroups" >> "$REPORT" echo " Ports : 7554,7556,7552,7553,8544 - checkPortAvail" >> "$REPORT" echo "" >> "$REPORT" echo "READINESS SUMMARY" >> "$REPORT" echo " ${instance-READINESS_SUMMARY}" >> "$REPORT" echo "" >> "$REPORT" echo "SIGN-OFF" >> "$REPORT" echo " Approved by : $APPROVER" >> "$REPORT" echo " Approved at : $TS" >> "$REPORT" echo " Workflow : zowe-upgrade-readiness v1.0" >> "$REPORT" echo "" >> "$REPORT" echo "============================================================" >> "$REPORT" echo " Retain this report for change management records." >> "$REPORT" echo "============================================================" >> "$REPORT"
echo "Report written to: $REPORT" echo "" cat "$REPORT"
